<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>GROMACS | Yassir Boulaamane</title><link>https://yboulaamane.github.io/tags/gromacs/</link><atom:link href="https://yboulaamane.github.io/tags/gromacs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><description>GROMACS</description><generator>Hugo Blox Builder (https://hugoblox.com)</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 04 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><image><url>https://yboulaamane.github.io/media/icon_hu_4d696a8ace2a642b.png</url><title>GROMACS</title><link>https://yboulaamane.github.io/tags/gromacs/</link></image><item><title>Step-by-Step MD Simulation of a Protein–Ligand Complex with GROMACS</title><link>https://yboulaamane.github.io/blog/an-in-depth-guide-to-md-simulation-and-analysis-of-a-protein-ligand-complex/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yboulaamane.github.io/blog/an-in-depth-guide-to-md-simulation-and-analysis-of-a-protein-ligand-complex/</guid><description>&lt;p>This is a recorded CHARMM36 recipe, not a universal GROMACS map. The protein uses CHARMM36, the ligand uses CGenFF, and the write-up calls the solvent TIP3P. The commands below are the ones to copy. Menu numbers and index groups belong to the system they were answered on.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;code>em.mdp&lt;/code>, &lt;code>nvt.mdp&lt;/code>, &lt;code>npt.mdp&lt;/code>, and &lt;code>md.mdp&lt;/code> are not in this note. The production run is the 100 ns job written as &lt;code>md_0_100&lt;/code>. Ions use the short &lt;code>ions.mdp&lt;/code> that is included.&lt;/p>
&lt;figure style="margin:2rem 0;">
&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 640 520" role="img" aria-labelledby="gmx-pipe-title gmx-pipe-desc" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;">
&lt;title id="gmx-pipe-title">CHARMM36 protein-ligand setup through production&lt;/title>
&lt;desc id="gmx-pipe-desc">Nine stages: fix the PDB, build the protein topology, parameterize the ligand with CGenFF, merge, solvate and add ions, minimize, NVT, NPT, then a 100 ns production run named md_0_100.&lt;/desc>
&lt;defs>
&lt;marker id="arrow-gmx-pipe" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="7" refY="3.5" orient="auto">&lt;path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z" fill="currentColor"/>&lt;/marker>
&lt;/defs>
&lt;g fill="none" stroke-width="2">
&lt;rect x="28" y="64" width="180" height="64" rx="12" fill="#2f80ed" fill-opacity="0.10" stroke="#2f80ed"/>
&lt;rect x="230" y="64" width="180" height="64" rx="12" fill="#9b51e0" fill-opacity="0.10" stroke="#9b51e0"/>
&lt;rect x="432" y="64" width="180" height="64" rx="12" fill="#f2994a" fill-opacity="0.10" stroke="#f2994a"/>
&lt;rect x="28" y="168" width="180" height="64" rx="12" fill="#27ae60" fill-opacity="0.10" stroke="#27ae60"/>
&lt;rect x="230" y="168" width="180" height="64" rx="12" fill="#2f80ed" fill-opacity="0.10" stroke="#2f80ed"/>
&lt;rect x="432" y="168" width="180" height="64" rx="12" fill="#9b51e0" fill-opacity="0.10" stroke="#9b51e0"/>
&lt;rect x="28" y="292" width="180" height="64" rx="12" fill="#f2994a" fill-opacity="0.10" stroke="#f2994a"/>
&lt;rect x="230" y="292" width="180" height="64" rx="12" fill="#27ae60" fill-opacity="0.10" stroke="#27ae60"/>
&lt;rect x="432" y="292" width="180" height="64" rx="12" fill="#2f80ed" fill-opacity="0.10" stroke="#2f80ed"/>
&lt;path d="M208 96 L222 96" marker-end="url(#arrow-gmx-pipe)" stroke="currentColor"/>
&lt;path d="M410 96 L424 96" marker-end="url(#arrow-gmx-pipe)" stroke="currentColor"/>
&lt;path d="M522 128 L522 148 L118 148 L118 160" marker-end="url(#arrow-gmx-pipe)" stroke="currentColor"/>
&lt;path d="M208 200 L222 200" marker-end="url(#arrow-gmx-pipe)" stroke="currentColor"/>
&lt;path d="M410 200 L424 200" marker-end="url(#arrow-gmx-pipe)" stroke="currentColor"/>
&lt;path d="M522 232 L522 256 L118 256 L118 284" marker-end="url(#arrow-gmx-pipe)" stroke="currentColor"/>
&lt;path d="M208 324 L222 324" marker-end="url(#arrow-gmx-pipe)" stroke="currentColor"/>
&lt;path d="M410 324 L424 324" marker-end="url(#arrow-gmx-pipe)" stroke="currentColor"/>
&lt;/g>
&lt;g fill="currentColor" font-family="system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif" text-anchor="middle">
&lt;text x="320" y="36" font-size="22" font-weight="700">One system, nine stages&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="118" y="92" font-size="16" font-weight="700">Fix the PDB&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="118" y="114" font-size="14">pdbfixer&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="320" y="92" font-size="16" font-weight="700">Protein topology&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="320" y="114" font-size="14">pdb2gmx&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="522" y="92" font-size="16" font-weight="700">Ligand&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="522" y="114" font-size="14">CGenFF&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="118" y="196" font-size="16" font-weight="700">Merge&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="118" y="218" font-size="14">complex.gro&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="320" y="196" font-size="16" font-weight="700">Solvate, ions&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="320" y="218" font-size="14">1.4 nm, 0.15 M&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="522" y="196" font-size="16" font-weight="700">Minimize&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="522" y="218" font-size="14">em.mdp&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="118" y="320" font-size="16" font-weight="700">NVT&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="118" y="342" font-size="14">300 K&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="320" y="320" font-size="16" font-weight="700">NPT&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="320" y="342" font-size="14">Parrinello–Rahman&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="522" y="320" font-size="16" font-weight="700">100 ns&lt;/text>
&lt;text x="522" y="342" font-size="14">md_0_100&lt;/text>
